Falsifies `e1000e::platform_controller_hub::non_volatile_memory::proofs::a_word_read_stays_in_range_for_every_strap`.

The defect: read_word stops refusing a word past the shadow RAM's 2048 words, so a caller's word
offset reaches the flash registers unchecked.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(result == Err(Error::OutOfRange))`, on any word of 2048
or more.

diff --git a/src/platform_controller_hub/non_volatile_memory.rs b/src/platform_controller_hub/non_volatile_memory.rs
